   ╭─ Help ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   
   │                                                                        │   
   │     Main screen                                                        │   
   │      ↑↓ j k   select a preset                                          │   
   │      ←→ h l   select an agent of the preset                            │   
   │      enter    open it: agents, model, permissions                      │   
   │      a        edit the selected agent                                  │   
   │      e        equip it (write it into ~/.claude, after a preview)      │   
   │      t        try it: start claude with it, writing nothing            │   
   │      u        live tokens of this folder's Claude Code sessions        │   
   │      m        check which models you can use                           │   
   │      n c r d  new, clone, rename, delete                               │   
   │      i x      import a shared preset, export the selected one          │   
   │      /        filter the list                                          │   
   │                                                                        │   
   │     Editing                                                            │   
   │      esc      go back; changes are saved as you make them              │   
   │      ctrl+c   quit from anywhere                                       │   
   │                                                                        │   
   │     Commands  in your shell                                            │   
   │     ↓ more · ↑↓ scroll                                                 │   
   │                                                                        │   
   ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯   
  ↑↓  scroll   any key  close